%[text] $\\begin{array}{rcl}\\mathbf{\\dot{x}(t)&=&\\mathbf{Ax}(t)+\\mathbf{B}u(t)\\\\\n&=&\\left \[\\begin{array}{cccc}\n                -5 &-1& -3 &0\\\\\n               0 &-4& -19& -3\\\\\n               -2 &0& 0& -4\\\\\n              0 &0 &0 &-6\n\\end{array}\\right\]\\mathbf{x}(t)+\\left\[\\begin{array}{c}2\\\\3\\\\0\\\\1\\end{array}\\right\]u(t)\\\\\ny(t)&=&\\mathbf{Cx}(t)\\\\\n     &=&\\left\[\\begin{array}{cccc}0&2& 0 &-5\\end{array}\\right\]\\mathbf{x}(t)\n\\end{array}${"altText":"  "}
